1
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:06,240
Orders just started rolling in!

2
00:00:13,244 --> 00:00:14,244
Wait, what?

3
00:00:14,886 --> 00:00:16,501
It's sold out already?!

4
00:00:17,722 --> 00:00:18,543
Oh—yes!

5
00:00:18,659 --> 00:00:20,110
This is huge!

6
00:00:23,378 --> 00:00:24,093
Guys,

7
00:00:24,218 --> 00:00:26,298
looks like we need to start
a second production run.

8
00:00:27,545 --> 00:00:28,545
Eunwoo,

9
00:00:28,737 --> 00:00:30,000
check the fabric stock

10
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:31,761
and place orders
for anything we're short on.

11
00:00:31,761 --> 00:00:32,261
Okay!

12
00:00:32,351 --> 00:00:34,746
Yubin, call the factory and see

13
00:00:34,746 --> 00:00:36,974
if they can start
extra production right away.

14
00:00:37,348 --> 00:00:38,348
Sure!

15
00:00:44,484 --> 00:00:45,484
Just one more box!

16
00:00:54,776 --> 00:00:56,456
When are we gonna finish packing all this?

17
00:00:56,989 --> 00:00:59,351
Seriously, we might be packing all day.

18
00:01:08,312 --> 00:01:09,672
Should we leave packing for later?

19
00:01:10,230 --> 00:01:11,230
Yeah.

20
00:01:22,208 --> 00:01:23,236
What about Eunwoo?

21
00:01:23,498 --> 00:01:25,459
Said she's tired and needs a nap.

22
00:01:28,768 --> 00:01:29,796
What should we eat?

23
00:01:35,636 --> 00:01:37,276
Burgers. Like, really good handmade ones.

24
00:01:38,314 --> 00:01:40,314
Sounds good. Let's go get burgers.

25
00:01:50,263 --> 00:01:51,263
Let's go.

26
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:07,300
"An Office Thing"
